=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.luogu.com/article/1ndosdfs\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"洛谷专栏\" />\n        <script id=\"luogu-theme\" type=\"application/json\">{\"id\":1,\"lNavi\":{\"back\":\"#ffffff\",\"fore\":\"#262626\",\"logo\":null},\"lBody\":{\"back\":\"#f0f4fa\",\"blur\":1000,\"fade\":1000,\"image\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn.luogu.com.cn\\/images\\/bg\\/fe\\/luogu4-bg-l.jpg\",\"midOpts\":{\"size\":\"cover\"}},\"dNavi\":{\"back\":\"#1d2025\",\"fore\":\"#ffffff\",\"logo\":\"#ffffff\"},\"dBody\":{\"back\":\"#0d1018\",\"blur\":1000,\"fade\":1000,\"image\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn.luogu.com.cn\\/images\\/bg\\/fe\\/luogu4-bg-d.jpg\",\"midOpts\":{\"size\":\"cover\"}}}</script>\n    <style></style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div id=\"app\">\n    <noscript>\n        <h3>请<b style=\"color:#f00;\">不要禁用</b>脚本，否则网页无法正常加载</h3>\n    </noscript>\n        <article>\n        <h1>津津的储蓄计划</h1>\n        <p style=\"font-size: .75em;\">\n            <a rel=\"author\">CH_wuji</a>\n            ·\n            <time datetime=\"2023-01-31T15:07:45+08:00\">2023-01-31 15:07:45</time>\n            ·\n            <a href=\"/article?category=1\">个人记录</a>\n        </p>\n\n        <p>P1089 [NOIP2004 提高组] 津津的储蓄计划  今天第一天来到洛谷题库，也是看见了这一题真是<del>非常简单</del>好吧，ok呀话不多说，上代码！（变量名有所改变，可以复制转载）</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-cpp\">#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;\nint main()\n{\n    int me = 0, mom = 0, spend, i;\n    for (i = 1; i &lt;= 12; i++)\n    {\n        me += 300; // 每个月多300元\n        scanf(\"%d\", &amp;spend);\n        me -= spend; // 减去预算\n        if (me &lt; 0) // 如果超支\n        {\n            me = -i; // me变为-月份\n            break; // 退出循环，无需再计算\n        }\n        mom += me / 100 * 100; // 整百存给妈妈\n        me %= 100; // 自己留下零钱\n    }\n    if (me &lt; 0) printf(\"%d\", me); // 如果me&lt;0，说明超支\n    else printf(\"%g\", me + mom * 1.2); // 否则输出手上的钱\n    return 0;\n}\n</code></pre>\n    </article>\n</div>\n<script>(function(){function c(){var b=a.contentDocument||(a.contentWindow&&a.contentWindow.document